{"id":1694,"date":"2020-12-04T19:20:49","date_gmt":"2020-12-05T03:20:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=1694"},"modified":"2024-09-01T15:34:15","modified_gmt":"2024-09-01T22:34:15","slug":"codrone-python-windows-python-installation","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/codrone-python-windows-python-installation\/","title":{"rendered":"Windows Python Installation"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22156e1d373\" name=\"6a22156e1d373\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>What is Python?<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Humans and computers do not speak the same language; if you tried to talk to a computer using your everyday language, it wouldn&#8217;t be able to understand you! Humans need to write code or programs to be able to communicate with computers. Python is one of the many programming languages that has been developed for this purpose.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22156e1d48b\" name=\"6a22156e1d48b\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Why Python?<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Python is easy to learn for first-time programmers. It&#8217;s readable and modular, which means that blocks of code can easily be transferred across programs to reuse! Python is also very efficient. You can write complex programs with fewer lines than in many other languages.<\/p>\n<p>Python also supports many other languages and eases communication between various components. You can have an LCD screen, a couple of buttons, and an Uno Arduino board and then combine a library that works with the screen, the buttons, and the board into a single code to create a device.<\/p>\n<p>Students of all ages and backgrounds are exploring what you can do with Python. It has many applications, from web design to home assistants. Its growing network of support for learners just like you makes Python a popular choice.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22156e1d4eb\" name=\"6a22156e1d4eb\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Video tutorial<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]This video tutorial will walk you through the Python installation for Windows. The steps are also outlined below in separate steps. NOTE: When choosing the version of Python to install, make sure that you select version 3.7.8.[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/youtu.be\/uAHbtxUkMV8&#8243; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22156e1d556\" name=\"6a22156e1d556\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Installing Python (Part 1)<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Follow this link to download the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.python.org\/downloads\/release\/python-378\/\">3.7.8 Python release<\/a>. This is the most stable version of Python for CoDrone Pro. Once on the web page. You should have the bottom gray area pop up showing a Python .exe file. Download this file and open it when its complete.[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1703&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1704&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22156e1d5ba\" name=\"6a22156e1d5ba\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 5<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Installing Python (Part 2)<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]If you have Windows 10, this window should pop up similar to the first image. Go ahead and select &#8220;Install anyway&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>After that, another window will pop up like the second image. <strong>Please make sure to select the option that says &#8220;Add Python (your version here) to PATH&#8221; BEFORE you select &#8220;Install Now&#8221;.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A new window should pop up showing the third image.<\/p>\n<p>When Setup Progress is complete, you should have something similar to the fourth image and then click on &#8220;Close&#8221;. You have completed downloading Python![\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1697&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1700&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1701&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1702&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 6 What is Python? [vc_column_text]Humans and computers do not speak the same language; if you tried to talk to a computer using your everyday language, it wouldn't be&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/codrone-python-windows-python-installation\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured_media":1755,"template":"","meta":{"_initial_content":"","_new_post":false,"_quiz_has_questions":false,"_lesson_complexity":"easy","_lesson_length":10,"_lesson_course":808,"_lesson_preview":"preview"},"lesson-category":[],"lesson-tag":[2226,2165,2177,2170,2122,2134],"class_list":["post-1694","lesson","type-lesson","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","lesson-tag-codrone-lite","lesson-tag-codrone-pro","lesson-tag-getting-started"